-- title:
--   Bender–Glauberman §1C: Frattini and Burnside operator lemmas (Lemmas 1.7–1.10)
-- statement:
--   Formalizes the shared finite $p$-group statements of Bender–Glauberman §1: Lemma 1.7 (Frattini quotient is elementary abelian) and Lemmas 1.8–1.10 (the Burnside operator machinery on $p$-groups and fixed points of coprime automorphisms).
--
--   Main definitions: `coprime_stabilizes_chain_trivial` (BG Lemma 1.9, multi-step general form: a coprime action stabilizing a chain acts trivially), `restrictAction` (restricting an operator action $A\to\mathrm{Aut}(G)$ to an $A$-invariant subgroup), and `coprime_nilpotent_acts_trivially_of_centralizer_self` (BG Proposition 1.10: for $A$ acting coprimely on a nilpotent $G$ with self-centralizing condition, the action is trivial).
--
--   The bundle also proves 8 supporting lemmas used by later statements.
